      "id": 806,
      "title": "Embracing Digital Transformation",
      "summary": "Embracing Digital Transformation Embracing Digital Home Guidance Briefings (EDTW) What changed Interviews (EDT) How others did it Architectural Deep Dives What to do next Learn Digital Transformation Overview Pillars AI, Cyber, Data, Edge, Computing, Comms ODXA Domains &amp; mappings Whitepapers Monthly canonical synthesis Articles Explainers &amp; analysis Lectures (DTA) Learning series Intelligence Community Community Newsletter Patreon LinkedIn About About Host Sponsors Shop Search Eric Hornsby LinkedIn Profile Biography قيد التحديد Topics edgecomputing datamanagement infrastructure generativeai multicloud zerotrust cybersecurity people process policy Latest Episodes Realizing Smart City Potential In this episode, Darren talks with Eric Hornsby, CEO of SmartPoint.io, about technology for realizing smart city potential. edgecomputing datamanagement infrastructure generativeai multicloud zerotrust cybersecurity people process policy Copyright &copy; Paidar Productions LLC All rights reserved",
